{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no, you got hit by a truck and died.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately you have been reincarnated as a dungeon core!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you know is what's inside your dungeon domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you want is to grow stronger and expand your dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Dungeon Is You is a modern incremental management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lure raiders into your dungeon with Loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your core, it is your last line of defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Knowledge to unlock new features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and summon minions to defend you dungeon and upgrade them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your individual minions freely inside your dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create new dungeon floors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WIP) Modify your core with idols and create powerful effect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WIP) Send your minions on expeditions to bring back powerful idols or new items to research</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WIP) Refine items from expeditions and unlock new skills</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2944490?t=1771769471","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944490/371bf280321eb01d7768e0128b579572f9aebddb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771769471","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944490/fa407543fbe0ab4f1675e94b6667df2e2dff6540/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771769471","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944490/fa407543fbe0ab4f1675e94b6667df2e2dff6540/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771769471","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4416240,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh no, you got hit by a truck and died.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortunately you have been reincarnated as a dungeon core!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you know is what's inside your dungeon domain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you want is to grow stronger and expand your dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Dungeon Is You is a modern incremental management game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lure raiders into your dungeon with Loot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your core, it is your last line of defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather Knowledge to unlock new features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and summon minions to defend you dungeon and upgrade them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your individual minions freely inside your dungeon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create new dungeon floors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WIP) Modify your core with idols and create powerful effect</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WIP) Send your minions on expeditions to bring back powerful idols or new items to research</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(WIP) Refine items from expeditions and unlock new skills</p>","developers":["Olaf Es Saadi"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2944490/1ebb3eab3c6e0882c3fcde6e06f6998f7e5b11f2/header.jpg?t=1771769471","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2944490/141500327/a6ab70c507312090996717c3278f4844e7d33684/1770837372/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770842964